    "show_share": true,
    "description": "With an aim to build the capacity of Maldivian nurse educators for designing, implementing, and evaluating simulation-based education as a pedagogy for clinical teaching in nursing, MOU has been signed between AKU-SONAM and  Maldives National University , reinforcing the SONAM's commitment to the professional development of nursing educators. This venture was carried out in collaboration with AKU's state-of-the-art  Center for Innovation in Medical Education (CIME)  and reflects a shared commitment to advancing simulation-based clinical teaching methodologies in nursing education for an eventual better health outcome.",
